{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10712","headline":"後出塞五首 四 · 杜甫","name":"後出塞五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献凯日继踵，两蕃静无虞。\n渔阳豪侠地，击鼓吹笙竽。\n云帆转辽海，稉稻来东吴。\n越罗与楚练，照耀舆台躯。\n主将位益崇，气骄凌上都。\n边人不敢议，议者死路衢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}